@HeapReacipesApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5036

GET {{HeapReacipesApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Extract a recipe from an image (replace the token and local file path)
POST {{HeapReacipesApi_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-image
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=recipe-image-boundary

--recipe-image-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="recipe.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./recipe.jpg
--recipe-image-boundary--
